{
  "id": "JDG.19",
  "number": "19",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Waamuzi 19",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo ambapo hapakuwepo na mfalme katika Israeli, kulikuwa na Mlawi fulani aliyeishi kama mgeni mbali katika eneo la milima ya Efraimu. Mtu huyo alichukua suria kutoka Bethlehemu nchini Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini suria huyo akamkasirikia;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "akamkasirikia:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania; tafsiri nyingine: Akamvunjia uaminifu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " huyo Mlawi, akamwacha na kurudi nyumbani kwa baba yake huko Bethlehemu, akakaa kwa muda wa miezi minne. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku moja, mumewe alikwenda kumtafuta; alikusudia kuongea naye vizuri na kumrudisha nyumbani kwake. Basi huyo mwanamume alikwenda pamoja na mtumishi wake na punda wawili. Basi yule mwanamke akampeleka ndani kwa baba yake, naye baba mkwe",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:3",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "mkwe:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Akampeleka kwa baba yake.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wake alipomwona akampokea kwa furaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba mkwe wake akamkaribisha, naye akakaa huko kwa muda wa siku tatu; huyo Mlawi na mtumishi wake wakala, wakanywa na kulala huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya nne, wakaamka asubuhi na mapema, wakajitayarisha kuondoka; lakini baba wa yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Kwanza kula chakula kidogo upate nguvu, kisha uondoke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi hao watu wawili wakakaa, wakala na kunywa pamoja. Kisha baba mkwe wake akamwambia, “Tafadhali ulale hapa usiku huu na kufurahi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu aliposimama akitaka kuondoka, baba mkwe wake akamhimiza abaki, naye akabaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya tano huyo mtu aliamka asubuhi, akitaka kuondoka. Lakini baba yake yule mwanamke akamwambia, “Kwanza upate nguvu kwa kula, ungoje alasiri, halafu uondoke.” Basi wote wawili wakala pamoja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo Mlawi na suria wake pamoja na mtumishi wake walipoinuka kwenda zao, baba mkwe wake akamwambia huyo Mlawi, “Sasa mchana umekwisha na jioni imekaribia. Ulale hapa, na kufurahi. Kesho asubuhi utaamka mapema kuanza safari yako ya kurudi nyumbani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini huyo mtu alikataa kulala huko usiku huo. Basi, akainuka, akaondoka akafika karibu na mji wa Yebusi (yaani Yerusalemu). Alikuwa na wale punda wake wawili waliotandikwa tayari, pamoja na suria wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipokuwa wamekaribia mjini Yebusi, siku ilikuwa karibu imekwisha; naye mtumishi akamwambia bwana wake, “Sasa heri tuingie katika mji huu wa Wayebusi tulale humo usiku huu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana wake akamjibu, “Hatutageuka na kuingia katika mji wa wageni ambao si Waisraeli. Tutaendelea na safari mpaka Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twende tukaribie sehemu hizo na kulala huko Gibea au Rama.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, wakaendelea na safari yao mpaka jua likatua wakiwa karibu na mji wa Gibea ambao ni mji wa kabila la Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaingia mjini wapate kulala humo usiku. Walipoingia mjini wakaenda kukaa kwenye uwanja wa wazi wa mji, kwani hakuna mtu aliyewakaribisha nyumbani kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipokuwa huko mzee mmoja akafika kutoka shambani kwake. Mzee huyo alikuwa mwenyeji wa nchi ya milima ya Efraimu na alikuwa akiishi huko Gibea kama mgeni. Wakazi wa mji wa Gibea walikuwa wa kabila la Benyamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzee huyo alipotazama na kumwona huyo msafiri akiwa huko uwanjani, alimwuliza, “Umetoka wapi na unakwenda wapi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akamjibu, “Tumetoka Bethlehemu nchini Yuda na tunaelekea sehemu za mbali za eneo la milima ya Efraimu. Huko ndiko ninakoishi na sasa ninarudi safarini huko Bethlehemu katika Yuda na kurejea nyumbani;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19:18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kurejea nyumbani:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kulingana na tafsiri ya Kigiriki; makala ya Kiebrania ina: Nakwenda katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, msemo ambao hauafiki.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " hakuna mtu hapa aliyetukaribisha nyumbani kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini sisi watumishi wako tuna nyasi na malisho kwa ajili ya punda wetu. Pia nina mkate na divai; hivyo vinanitosha mimi, suria wangu na mtumishi wangu. Hatupungukiwi kitu chochote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Huyo mzee akamwambia, “Amani iwe nanyi! Nitawapa mahitaji yote. Ila msilale huku uwanjani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo akawapeleka nyumbani kwake na kuwapa punda wao malisho. Hao wasafiri wakanawa miguu yao, wakala na kunywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walipokuwa wanajifurahisha, kumbe wanaume mabaradhuli wa mji huo wakaja wakaizingira hiyo nyumba na kugonga mlangoni. Wakamwambia mzee mwenye nyumba, “Mtoe nje yule mwanamume aliyekuja kwako, tulale naye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini huyo mzee mwenye nyumba akatoka nje, akawaambia “Sivyo ndugu zangu; nawasihi msitende uovu huo. Huyu ni mgeni wangu, hivyo msimtendee ubaya huo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninaye bado binti yangu ambaye ni bikira na yupo pia yule suria wa mgeni wangu. Niruhusuni niwatoe nje, muwachukue na kuwatendea kama mnavyotamani; lakini mtu huyu msimtendee jambo hilo la kipumbavu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini wanaume hao hawakumsikiliza. Kwa hiyo Mlawi yule akamchukua suria wake na kumtoa kwao huko nje. Nao wakamchukua na kumnajisi usiku kucha mpaka asubuhi. Karibu na mapambazuko, wakamwacha aende zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asubuhi, yule mwanamke akaja mpaka mlangoni mwa nyumba alimokuwa bwana wake, akaanguka chini hapo mlangoni na kukaa hapo mpaka kulipopambazuka kabisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
